{
  "id": 1737,
  "name": "prosciutto",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。ハムと　違って　加熱していないためフレッシュな　味わいが　楽しめる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛이 강한 식재료. 햄과는 달리 가열하지 않아서 신선한 맛을 즐길 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味強勁的食材。不同於火腿，未經加熱，因此能嚐到新鮮的滋味。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé. Contrairement au jambon blanc, il n’est pas cuit, ce qui lui donne un goût plus frais.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr salzige Zutat. Da die rohe Variante anders als Kochschinken keinen Garprozess durchlaufen muss, entfaltet sie einen herrlich frischen Geschmack.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene un sabor muy salado, pero, al estar curado y no cocido, conserva un sabor más auténtico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato. Non essendo stato sottoposto a cottura, ha un sapore più fresco rispetto al Prosciutto cotto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This ingredient is very salty like regular ham, but the difference is prosciutto is not cooked after it is cured, giving it a fun freshness.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "塩味が　強い　食材。ハムと　違って　加熱していないためフレッシュな　味わいが　楽しめる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "咸味很强的食材。因为与火腿不同，并没有加热，所以能享受新鲜的味道。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
